      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And on Cantwara lage, cyning and arcebiscop agan gelicne and efen dyrne mundbryce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in the laws of the Kentish people, the king and archbishop are owed an equal and likewise costly penalty for the violation of their protection.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 on Cantwara lage cyning 7 arcebiscop agan gelicne and efen dyrne mundbryce.</ab>
